        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3068710/extras/bbb48f0f4132e74c03c504825fc45c13.avif?t=1765362714\" width=720 height=330 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Vextorial, you play as Pilo, a curious 2D being navigating a vast, ancient ruin suspended in constantly changing dimensions. As you journey through this surreal world, you’ll swap between 2D and 3D perspectives, manipulate gravity to forge new paths, and solve mind-bending puzzles that defy conventional space. Along the way, you’ll encounter a cast of strange and intriguing characters, each with their own perspective on this world, who will guide you on your quest to uncover the truth behind your lost memories.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3068710/extras/e22149c6d56c503209fa7062d71b24c9.avif?t=1765362714\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3068710/extras_big/e22149c6d56c503209fa7062d71b24c9.avif?t=1765362714 width=800 height=160 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You awaken with no memory of who you are or why you’ve come to this place, only that the world itself reacts to you in impossible ways. Planes rotate. Gravity bends. Walls become floors. Every step forward unravels another thread of a mystery hidden deep within the shifting geometry.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3068710/extras/820e489b535ac9f2d39b94e860772522.avif?t=1765362714\" width=780 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3068710/extras/66f81b5b8002c3af48ffb7c53fe0410d.avif?t=1765362714\" width=1200 height=229 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Twist and turn, a surreal 3D world from your 2D perspective</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3068710/extras/da2065c924536b0cca3e7de1fa5150c3.poster.avif?t=1765362714\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3068710/extras/da2065c924536b0cca3e7de1fa5150c3.webm?t=1765362714\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3068710/extras/da2065c924536b0cca3e7de1fa5150c3.mp4?t=1765362714\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3068710/extras/6a6d4589a8a8bf8b9ec901c80893302b.avif?t=1765362714\" width=1200 height=229 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Unearth cryptic fragments of memory and lost history</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3068710/extras/e59fb283c924b254cd6add3e8bb9e052.poster.avif?t=1765362714\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3068710/extras/e59fb283c924b254cd6add3e8bb9e052.webm?t=1765362714\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3068710/extras/e59fb283c924b254cd6add3e8bb9e052.mp4?t=1765362714\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3068710/extras/77186d361d47c8f7184f178c2977ad54.avif?t=1765362714\" width=1200 height=229 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong><i>Shift gravity to forge impossible paths through space</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3068710/extras/bdeaa37e2a55de8183272ca480f268d2.poster.avif?t=1765362714\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3068710/extras/bdeaa37e2a55de8183272ca480f268d2.webm?t=1765362714\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3068710/extras/bdeaa37e2a55de8183272ca480f268d2.mp4?t=1765362714\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3068710/extras/77b15fe6a3fd882c30f54b5fb3571111.avif?t=1765362714\" width=1200 height=229 /></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Solve Meta-Puzzles in hub areas to progress through the game</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3068710/extras/d20ba9d56fe55043d2429bb3dd1a3ed4.poster.avif?t=1765362714\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3068710/extras/d20ba9d56fe55043d2429bb3dd1a3ed4.webm?t=1765362714\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3068710/extras/d20ba9d56fe55043d2429bb3dd1a3ed4.mp4?t=1765362714\" type=\"video/mp4